{"run": 1, "id": 207, "dataset_kind": "relevant", "expect_refusal": false, "as_of": null, "status": "ok", "first_token_s": 10.92, "total_s": 10.924, "result": "answer", "citations": 3, "thread_id": "t-8354ff727948", "cited_chunk_ids": ["258819922c474062", "ab0dc85b6ea79c85", "a4cc80dc17fcc437"], "cited_version_dates": ["2026-02-09", "2025-01-04", "2025-01-04"], "cost_usd": 0.00663529, "input_tokens": 54155, "output_tokens": 7429, "llm_calls": 12, "error_code": null, "answer_chars": 347, "answer": "대시보드를 Production에 게시하려면 Tableau Project Lead의 승인을 받고, 데이터 보안 통제와 콘텐츠 고유성을 충족해야 하며, 문서는 GitLab Handbook에 작성해 연결해야 합니다 [1]. 금액은 USD로 표시하고 $10,000 이상은 k, $1,000,000 이상은 m으로 줄여 씁니다 [2]. 반올림은 대상에 맞게 하며, 임원급 차트는 십·백·천 단위 반올림으로 충분하고 금액 외에는 일반적으로 전체 형태로 표시합니다 [3].\n\n기준일 2026-11-16 · 근거 판 날짜 2026-02-09, 2025-01-04 · 출처: GitLab Handbook (CC BY-SA 4.0, 수정됨)", "cost_by_step": {"classify/classify": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 1421, "output_tokens": 19, "cost_usd": 3.685e-05, "llm_s": 1.06, "cache_read_tokens": 1275, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}, "search/decompose_gate": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 597, "output_tokens": 93, "cost_usd": 0.0001062, "llm_s": 1.164, "cache_read_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}, "search/decompose": {"calls": 1, "input_tokens": 595, "output_tokens": 326, "cost_usd": 0.0002225, "llm_s": 1.759, "cache_read_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}, "write_answer/answer_fast": {"calls": 2, "input_tokens": 10894, "output_tokens": 1323, "cost_usd": 0.00120694, "llm_s": 6.187, "cache_read_tokens": 6044, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}, "judge/judge": {"calls": 3, "input_tokens": 17487, "output_tokens": 3081, "cost_usd": 0.00252996, "llm_s": 14.622, "cache_read_tokens": 8436, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}, "ground/grounding": {"calls": 4, "input_tokens": 23161, "output_tokens": 2587, "cost_usd": 0.00253284, "llm_s": 10.488, "cache_read_tokens": 11964, "cache_creation_tokens": 0}}, "cost_by_step_total_usd": 0.00663529, "embed_tokens": 0, "embed_calls": 0, "embed_cos